als\":deals[-limit:]}))", "selftest_args_json": "{\"query\":\"apple\",\"category\":\"food\",\"limit\":5}", "why": "Agents often search the catalog and then immediately search the ledger for the resulting products. This bundles those calls and supports the frequent category and shop filters, returning catalog matches alongside matching settled deals."}
